{"last_link_id": 75, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [1586.3812255859375, 1323.5838623046875], "pos": [5087.38818359375, 272.15850830078125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 60, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 49, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [345.1251220703125, 484.70001220703125], "pos": [4241.6298828125, 308.55181884765625], "widgets_values": ["### 0. 任务前置判定分析（情境 A）\n**竞品图片分析：**\n您上传的两张图片为典型的传统提花/仿提花大花卉床品。花型结构以大牡丹/玫瑰为主，构图较为饱满但略显杂乱；色彩偏向传统的高饱和暖色调（粉黄、橘黄配暖绿），视觉上略显陈旧，容易产生“土气感”。\n**超越策略：**\n针对30-65岁中国女性的审美升级需求，我们将保留“富贵花卉（牡丹/玫瑰）”这一受众极度认可的吉祥符号，但在**色彩与技法上进行降维打击与质感升维**。\n1. **色彩高级化**：摒弃原图的艳丽感，提取4组具有“莫兰迪/新中式”质感的高级色彩（奶油底色、干枯玫瑰粉、鼠尾草绿、芥末金）。\n2. **技法纯粹化**：严格采用丝网印花平涂（Flat tint），彻底去除原图提花带来的噪点与渐变，用极其锐利的色块边缘（Pixel-perfect sharp edges）重塑花型轮廓，打造现代轻奢的精工印染感。\n\n---\n\n### [设计编号] TX-202310-Floral01\n### [热卖趋势卖点简述] 新中式轻奢平涂牡丹（富贵雅致风）\n\n**[Prompt]:**\n> An infographic orientation, technical layout, blueprint style design specification sheet. The entire image is enclosed by a 2cm wide #4A4A4A dark gray border. \n> **Top 2/3 area (side-by-side comparison):** \n> Left side: Flat lay, Top-down view of a 2m x 2.3m bedsheet featuring a Seamless botanical floral pattern of elegant large peonies and roses. The artwork strictly uses a 4-color palette: Cream base (#F5F1E7), Dusty Rose flowers (#D97A84), Sage Green leaves (#7D9376), and Mustard Gold details (#CBA052). Strict execution of Flat tint, Screen print style, Pixel-perfect sharp edges. Absolutely no watercolor, no gradients, no feathering, no shading. \n> Right side: A square Singular repeat unit (80cm x 80cm representation). This must be a 1:1 ratio matching the exact scale of the left side's pattern, a non-magnified repeat unit, with No internal tiling. \n> **Bottom 1/3 area (legend at bottom):** \n> Left zone: 4 square color blocks displayed side-by-side with exact hex code labels underneath (#F5F1E7, #D97A84, #7D9376, #CBA052). \n> Right zone: A beautifully formatted Chinese text marketing description block. The title is \"【受众群体喜欢理由】\" in bold, followed by descriptive text explaining the elegant aesthetic and auspicious meaning of the floral design for mature women. 8k resolution, professional textile design presentation.\n\n**[Color Specs]:**\n*   **Color 1 (Base):** `#F5F1E7` (奶油霜白 - 提亮卧室空间，温润不刺眼)\n*   **Color 2 (Main Motif):** `#D97A84` (干枯玫瑰粉 - 褪去艳俗，保留女性柔美与牡丹的富贵感)\n*   **Color 3 (Foliage):** `#7D9376` (鼠尾草绿 - 高级灰调绿色，带来宁静与生机)\n*   **Color 4 (Accents):** `#CBA052` (芥末金 - 用于花蕊与枝干的锐利勾勒，增添低调奢华的质感)\n\n*(注：右下角渲染出的中文文本块内容预设为：“此设计精准契合30-65岁中国女性对‘富贵雅致’的审美诉求。主花卉选用象征富贵吉祥的牡丹，寓意家庭美满；摒弃传统艳俗色彩，采用高级灰调的‘干枯玫瑰粉’搭配‘芥末金’勾勒骨架，色彩稳重且极具质感。锐利的平涂分色技法既保留了传统床品的端庄感，又注入了现代家居的精致度。”)*"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 40, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 41, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [40, 61], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 398], "pos": [3694.79296875, 890.7067260742188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "", "2,0", 0.6, 169091240, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 72, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 73, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image